---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About — Camille Aubert"
  description="Learn more about Camille Aubert, Lead Developer & AI Solutions Architect focused on AI systems, scalable architecture, and industrial-grade delivery."
>
  <section class="section-container max-w-3xl mx-auto pt-16 md:pt-24">
    <p class="text-accent text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold font-body">About</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-bold text-maintext mt-3 leading-tight">
      Engineering reliable intelligence for production environments.
    </h1>
    <p class="text-subtext font-body text-lg leading-relaxed mt-6">
      I am a Lead Developer and Solutions Architect committed to the "1% excellence"
      philosophy. I specialize in deploying AI as a core performance multiplier within industrial
      environments, bridging the gap between cutting-edge research and reliable production systems.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section-container max-w-3xl mx-auto content-section">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-maintext">Approach</h2>
    <p class="text-subtext font-body leading-relaxed mt-3">
      Architecture is the new productivity. I build deterministic, scalable systems that shift focus
      from manual code execution to the orchestration of autonomous intelligent agents.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section-container max-w-3xl mx-auto content-section">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-maintext">What I do</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3">
      <li class="flex gap-3 text-subtext font-body leading-relaxed">
        <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">→</span>
        AI Systems Architecture (RAG, LLM, Multi-agent orchestration).
      </li>
      <li class="flex gap-3 text-subtext font-body leading-relaxed">
        <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">→</span>
        High-Performance Full-Stack Development (PHP/Laravel, React).
      </li>
      <li class="flex gap-3 text-subtext font-body leading-relaxed">
        <span class="text-accent mt-0.5">→</span>
        Industrial Infrastructure Automation (Docker, AWS, CI/CD).
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Layout>
